slot 0-23), f 63;
#X text 38 942 recall presets by holding the aux key and pressing one
of the 24 keys. be aware that the first key = preset 0 and so on. also
hitting the aux button cancels stuck notes so when changing through
presets it won't get stuck and use it as a panic button whenever midi
notes get stuck.;
