#X text 35 790 Instructions: Each box is an operator with adsr \, modulation
\, pan \, master out \, freq envelope \, freq envelope's amount and
4 number boxes to create custom algorithms. conceptually based on the
'expert' window in FM8. When something sounds good set the number by
the Red bang(0-23(total of 24 presets in one patch instance)) \, than
click on it to save the sound. Click on the blue button to write these
24 presets to permanent memory (saved as .txt files on the organelle
thumb drive). **If you don't click the blue button none of the sounds
will be saved for the next session**.;
